name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q13_2026'

question 'A smart-home app turns on the porch light when someone arrives home but only if it is not already bright outside. Which logical operator handles the "not already bright" part?'

right 'NOT (!) — the light should turn on only when the bright condition is false.'
wrong 'AND — the light needs both conditions to be true.'
wrong 'OR — either condition triggers the light.'
wrong 'No operator — the light just checks the time of day.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

